# Feature: account
# Use-case: uc.account.change-email
# Use-case doc: ../../../../docs/wiki/features/account/use-cases/uc.account.change-email.md

### Request email change
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/email-change/request
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newEmail": "{{accountNewEmail}}"
}

### Confirm email change
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/email-change/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{emailChangeToken}}"
}
